WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
One rectangle of construction paper

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Make the center crease

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Open the sheet again

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Left edge to the center

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Right edge to the center

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Fan the right flap outward

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Fan the left flap outward

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Fold the upper-right corner

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Fold the upper-left corner

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Turn the paper over

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Bring the top point to the bottom

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Fold the small right shoulder

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Fold the small left shoulder

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Lift the point over the small corners

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Turn over to expose the small point

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Fold the small exposed point down

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Close the model along its center

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Fold the first wing, keeping a body strip

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Fold the matching wing on the other side

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Open the wings into flying position

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.000
Your finished flying bat — all sides
